          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "route-rules",
          "text": "路由规则生效：implementation_gap→beacon-implement, truth_drift→beacon-change, coverage_gap→beacon-test-case, execution_lapse→beacon-qa；RELEASE_BLOCKING_FAMILIES 强制 block release（**Must**）",
